1
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:14,339
Hi! In this video, I'll show you how to run your gym day to day with GymBoss. Start by opening GymBoss on your laptop, and sign in with your email and password.

2
00:00:15,743 --> 00:00:25,783
This is your dashboard. The top cards show today's numbers: collection, new admissions, renewals and dues paid. They're at zero because the day has just started.

3
00:00:29,583 --> 00:00:35,213
If you run more than one branch, use this outlet switcher to see one branch, or all of them together.

4
00:00:36,215 --> 00:00:44,355
Scroll down for quick actions and your latest transactions. We'll come back here at the end of the day to see everything we did.

5
00:00:48,556 --> 00:00:53,726
Before adding members, let's check your plans. Tap Plans and Catalogue in the menu.

6
00:00:54,726 --> 00:01:06,236
Here are the gym's membership plans: monthly at fifteen hundred rupees, quarterly at four thousand, half-yearly and annual. The tabs above hold personal training, services and products.

7
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:16,790
Launching a new offer? Tap Add Membership, enter a name, the duration and the price, and save. Your new plan appears in the list straight away.

8
00:01:23,983 --> 00:01:28,233
A new member has just walked in. Go to Members, and tap Add Member.

9
00:01:32,034 --> 00:01:41,644
Step one is the basics. Type the member's name and mobile number, choose their gender, and the batch they'll train in. The member ID is created for you.

10
00:01:49,782 --> 00:01:57,202
Step two is optional. Add an email, height and weight, and any health notes, like an old knee injury, so your trainers know.

11
00:02:02,084 --> 00:02:13,873
Step three assigns the plan. Pick Quarterly for four thousand rupees, add a five hundred rupee admission fee, and a three hundred rupee discount. Karan pays two thousand rupees today, by UPI.

12
00:02:16,049 --> 00:02:27,849
The summary shows a total of four thousand two hundred rupees, two thousand collected, and two thousand two hundred still due. Tap Save, and Karan appears at the top of your member list.

13
00:02:29,251 --> 00:02:35,321
Later that evening, Karan comes back to clear his balance. Go to Payments, and tap Record Payment.

14
00:02:39,123 --> 00:02:46,903
Search for Karan. GymBoss shows exactly how much he still owes. Enter two thousand two hundred rupees, pick Cash, and save.

15
00:02:54,919 --> 00:03:01,659
A receipt is created instantly. You can download it as a PDF, print it, or share it with the member on WhatsApp.

16
00:03:02,659 --> 00:03:07,069
The payment now sits at the top of your payments list, with its own receipt number.

17
00:03:08,471 --> 00:03:17,181
Now, attendance. Tap Attendance. Members can scan your gym's QR code, punch in on a fingerprint machine, or you can check them in by hand.

18
00:03:20,982 --> 00:03:28,482
For a manual check-in, search for Karan and tap Check In. He now shows under Members today, and the check-in count goes up.

19
00:03:32,594 --> 00:03:40,634
Tap Show QR code to get one QR for your entrance. Print it, and members simply scan it with their phone camera. No app needed.

20
00:03:41,634 --> 00:03:47,734
The Staff today and History tabs show which of your team came in, and past attendance month by month.

21
00:03:50,012 --> 00:03:57,122
Every gym has members who haven't paid in full. On the Members page, tap Due to see only the people who owe you money.

22
00:04:01,081 --> 00:04:10,441
For the full picture, open Reports and choose Outstanding Dues. You'll see the total owed, and each member's balance, so you know who to follow up with.

23
00:04:11,842 --> 00:04:18,612
Dev's membership is running out soon. Search for him on the Members page, and tap his name to open his profile.

24
00:04:24,873 --> 00:04:30,513
His card shows the plan, the expiry date, and how many days are left. Tap Renew Membership.

25
00:04:31,513 --> 00:04:40,583
Choose the plan, enter what he's paying, fifteen hundred rupees for another month, pick UPI, and confirm. The new expiry date is worked out for you.

26
00:04:44,886 --> 00:04:49,516
Done. His expiry date has moved forward, and the renewal is saved as a payment.

27
00:04:54,162 --> 00:04:59,652
Next, reminders. Nisha still owes a balance. Open her profile and tap Send Payment Reminder.

28
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:16,360
Pick the type of reminder. GymBoss writes the message for you, with the member's name and the exact amount due.

29
00:05:17,361 --> 00:05:26,051
Tap Send, and WhatsApp opens with the message already typed. You just press send. Messages go from your own WhatsApp, one member at a time.

30
00:05:27,051 --> 00:05:39,321
You can also write your own message. Tap the WhatsApp button, type a holiday notice, and send it the same way. To message every member at once, you'll need the official WhatsApp Business connection.

31
00:05:44,024 --> 00:05:54,414
If a member is travelling or injured, pause their membership. Tap Freeze, check the dates, add a reason, and save. The days they miss are added back to their expiry.

32
00:05:59,690 --> 00:06:07,380
When someone walks in asking about prices, save them as an enquiry so you never lose the lead. Tap Enquiries, then Add Enquiry.

33
00:06:11,182 --> 00:06:17,282
Enter their name and phone number, where they heard about you, and what they're interested in. Then save.

34
00:06:25,462 --> 00:06:33,392
From the list, you can message them on WhatsApp, log a follow-up, or tap Convert when they join, which turns them into a member.

35
00:06:34,793 --> 00:06:39,843
To see your real profit, record your expenses too. Tap Expenses, then Add Expense.

36
00:06:43,644 --> 00:06:53,734
Enter the name, the category and the amount. Say, the electricity bill, eight thousand four hundred rupees by UPI. Save, and the monthly total updates right away.

37
00:07:02,771 --> 00:07:12,371
Under Staff, you'll find your team. Tap Add Staff to add a trainer or receptionist, and choose what they're allowed to see, like keeping finance private.

38
00:07:17,490 --> 00:07:22,480
Outlets lists your branches. Iron Paradise has two: Indiranagar and HSR Layout.

39
00:07:23,882 --> 00:07:30,172
Finance shows this month's money in one place: revenue, expenses, net cash flow, and outstanding dues.

40
00:07:34,940 --> 00:07:41,890
Reports has charts for revenue, member growth, dues, expiring memberships, and how many enquiries you convert.

41
00:07:50,216 --> 00:07:56,096
Tap Monthly PDF to download the full finance report for the month, ready to send to your accountant.

42
00:07:57,097 --> 00:08:04,647
And Export Center lets you download members, payments, attendance and more, as spreadsheet files, for any dates or branch.

43
00:08:06,048 --> 00:08:14,858
In Settings, you can update your gym's name and city, switch between light and dark mode, and connect WhatsApp Business and online payments.

44
00:08:26,282 --> 00:08:33,612
Your GymBoss plan and billing are under Subscription, and Help and Support connects you to our team on WhatsApp or email.

45
00:08:37,383 --> 00:08:42,573
Your own name, phone number and password are under My Profile, in the top-right menu.

46
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:54,679
Let's head back to the dashboard. Today's collection now includes Karan's admission, his balance payment, and Dev's renewal. The new admission and renewal are counted too.

47
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:03,400
Scroll down, and every payment we recorded today is listed under recent transactions.

48
00:09:05,333 --> 00:09:13,053
And that's a full day at the gym with GymBoss. Start your free trial today, and run your whole gym from one simple screen.
